title: "AxioWeave AW-001 Protocol Research Preview"
abstract: >-
  Public research preview of the AW-001 governance protocol artifacts: contracts,
  schemas, fixed action registries, fixtures, offline validators, tests and
  research documents. It excludes the private AW-002 Runtime and is not a
  production governance protocol.
